ui.helpTitle=Radeoner — help
ui.helpText=Radeoner v{0}.\n\nCtrl+Tab and Ctrl+Shift+Tab: next and previous tab. Ctrl+1 to Ctrl+5: select a tab directly. Tab and Shift+Tab: controls.\n\nReadings: Up/Down selects a parameter, Ctrl+A selects all rows and Ctrl+C copies them. Readings and tray update every second by default. Live readings can be disabled.\n\nF5: refresh settings. Ctrl+Enter: apply with confirmation. Ctrl+E and Ctrl+I: export/import JSON; import does not write to the GPU. Ctrl+Shift+S: save report. F6: last status.\n\nTuning: optional RGB through a local OpenRGB SDK server. Color, brightness and off are sent only after pressing a button.\n\nSettings: language, theme, text, startup, updates, About and support/contact. Updates show release notes; Yes starts installation.\n\nAlt+F4 hides to tray; Exit stops the app. A driver-child failure leaves the window open and readings retry. Local errors: Radeoner.log. After failed writes check actual settings with F5. Instructions: Readme.en.txt.
